 hint="" /><node index="4" text="驾驶会飞的校车游览旧金山。靠近屋顶喷出彩漆，可以把灰色建筑染上颜色。&#10;&#10;方向键或 WASD 驾驶，S 爬升，W 俯冲。空格喷漆，长按蓄力，E、Q 换挡。&#10;1. 巴士在地图加载后自动飞行。用左右方向键转弯，下键拉升，上键俯冲。初次转弯可先用 Q 降挡。&#10;2. 轻按空格喷彩，按住空格蓄力，松开喷出更大的彩团。E 升挡，Q 降挡，Esc 打开设置。&#10;3. 用触屏时，默认在屏幕右侧拖动可转向，向下拖爬升。轻点 MEGA 喷彩，按住可蓄力。&#10;&#10;原文对照&#10;MEGA  ·  喷彩／蓄力按钮&#10;Cruise  ·  巡航挡&#10;Express  ·  快速挡&#10;Nonstop  ·  直达挡&#10;Jet  ·  喷射挡&#10;TURBO  ·  涡轮加速" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.ecojust.hostedgames" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[208,711][1124,856]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.LinearLayout" package="com.ecojust.hostedgames" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[1136,215][1724,856]" drawing-order="2" hint=""><node index="0" text="同一 Wi-Fi 下扫码连接手柄" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.ecojust.hostedgames" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[1148,231][1712,279]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.widget.ImageView" package="com.ecojust.hostedgames" content-desc="手机手柄二维码" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[1148,279][1712,471]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="2" text="[pairing address omitted]" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.ecojust.hostedgames" content-desc="" checkable="fal